 Auricrux.Web/Services/SsrfGuard.cs        | 170 ++++++++++++++++++++++
 Auricrux.Web/Services/WebBrowseService.cs |  79 ++++++----
 3 files changed, 227 insertions(+), 28 deletions(-)
